  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/12/IMG_1917.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>&iquest;Se est&aacute; conviertiendo el Chaplin Caf&eacute; en un pub-biblioteca? &iexcl;&iexcl;&iexcl;NO!!! Es un local cada d&iacute;a m&aacute;s solidario con la Asociaci&oacute;n Conquistando Escalones repartiendo el libro La lluvia es una canci&oacute;n sin letra, de &Aacute;ngel Gil Cheza, por s&oacute;lo un donativo de 5 euros.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chaplincafellibresolidariangelgilcheza/img_1911.jpg\" alt=\"img_1911\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chaplincafellibresolidariangelgilcheza/img_1912.jpg\" alt=\"img_1912\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chaplincafellibresolidariangelgilcheza/img_1913.jpg\" alt=\"img_1913\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chaplincafellibresolidariangelgilcheza/img_1915.jpg\" alt=\"img_1915\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chaplincafellibresolidariangelgilcheza/img_1916.jpg\" alt=\"img_1916\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chaplincafellibresolidariangelgilcheza/img_1917.jpg\" alt=\"img_1917\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chaplincafellibresolidariangelgilcheza/img_1918.jpg\" alt=\"img_1918\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chaplincafellibresolidariangelgilcheza/img_1919.jpg\" alt=\"img_1919\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https